<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-brand/10 text-brand rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand/20 glow-brand">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[40px]">workspace_premium</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black dark:text-white text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
      Sube al Nivel <span class="text-brand">PRO</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm md:text-base dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-600 mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">
      Desbloquea el Coach de Inteligencia Artificial Avanzado, notificaciones en tiempo real, importación ilimitada y protecciones Anti-Drawdown.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <!-- BENEFITS LIST -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold dark:text-white text-slate-900 border-b pb-2 dark:border-darkBorder border-lightBorder">¿Qué incluye el plan PRO?</h3>
      
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-accent-green/20 text-accent-green flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-slate-900">AI Coach Personalizado (GPT-4)</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Análisis de cada trade evaluando tus métricas y detectando errores psicológicos invisibles.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-accent-green/20 text-accent-green flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-slate-900">Alertas Preventivas Real-Time</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Notificaciones automáticas antes de que caigas en overtrading o revancha.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-accent-green/20 text-accent-green flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">check</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-slate-900">Importador Multi-Broker ilimitado</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Sube CSVs desde NinjaTrader y Tradovate en 1 segundo reconociendo símbolos automáticamente.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl dark:bg-darkCard bg-slate-50 border dark:border-darkBorder border-lightBorder flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-500 text-[24px]">verified_user</span>
        <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-300 text-slate-600 font-medium">Transacción 100% segura procesada directamente por los servidores de PayPal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CHECKOUT BOX -->
    <div class="glass relative rounded-[2rem] p-8 border-2 border-brand/50 shadow-2xl shadow-brand/10">
      <!-- Decorator -->
      <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-1 bg-brand text-white text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest rounded-full uppercase glow-brand">
        Plan Más Popular
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold dark:text-slate-300 text-slate-600">Coach PRO</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand">$19</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 ml-1">/mes</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- SIMULADOR PAYPAL BUTTON -->
        <%= button_to subscription_path, method: :post, class: "w-full flex items-center justify-center py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0070BA] hover:bg-[#003087] text-white font-bold transition-all shadow-lg flex-col gap-1 group relative overflow-hidden" do %>
          <!-- Shine effect -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-x-[-100%] skew-x-[-15deg] group-hover:animate-[shine_1.5s_ease-in-out_infinite]"></div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 relative z-10">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.067 8.478c.492-.88.556-1.814.156-2.657-.393-.829-1.203-1.344-2.22-1.344H13.68c-.767 0-1.428.535-1.574 1.288L9.742 17.65c-.066.335.19.648.532.648h3.336l-1.077 5.766c-.035.188.113.336.3.336h3.407c.801 0 1.488-.588 1.637-1.378l1.37-7.2.146-.77c.105-.55.59-1.002 1.15-1.002h.671c1.942 0 3.327-.923 3.826-2.836.27-1.037.112-1.928-.273-2.736m-4.504 3.738h-.651c-1.127 0-1.745.86-1.93 1.848l-.001.005c-.015.083-.027.168-.04.25-.098.508-.553.882-1.068.882h-1.98l.685-3.666c.21-.861.98-1.48 1.866-1.48h2.365c.571 0 1.05.289 1.272.766.195.421.235.918.11 1.401-.137.534-.52.994-1.069 1.171z"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm font-black italic tracking-wide">Pagar con PayPal</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-blue-100/70 font-semibold relative z-10">(Simulador de Prueba)</span>
        <% end %>

        <p class="text-center text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Al hacer clic, nuestro simulador procesará la suscripción al instante en Base de Datos asignando la ID <span class="font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-darkHover px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-brand">SIM-PAYPAL-[ID]</span> para demostraciones.
        </p>

        <%= link_to dashboard_path, class: "w-full block text-center py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-brand transition-colors mt-2" do %>
          Volver al Dashboard
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
